export const themeDefaults={name:'Design v1',workspace:'#151a1d',chrome:'#1c252a',paper:'#efe6d2',ink:'#292924',accent:'#496257',muted:'#655d4a',headingFont:'Georgia',bodyFont:'system-ui',fontSize:16,lineHeight:1.48,cardRadius:12,cardPadding:30,readingWidth:1200};
export const themePresets={baseline:themeDefaults,storybook:{...themeDefaults,name:'Storybook · source-inspired candidate',paper:'#f7f4e9',ink:'#29262b',accent:'#80523a',headingFont:'Georgia',bodyFont:'Georgia',cardRadius:2},orbital:{...themeDefaults,name:'Orbital · synthetic science fiction',workspace:'#111925',chrome:'#192638',paper:'#e7eef5',ink:'#182739',accent:'#245e82',muted:'#52677e',headingFont:'system-ui',bodyFont:'system-ui',cardRadius:3}};
const colors=['workspace','chrome','paper','ink','accent','muted'];const fonts=['Georgia','system-ui','serif','sans-serif','monospace'];const ranges={fontSize:[12,24],lineHeight:[1.2,2],cardRadius:[0,24],cardPadding:[12,48],readingWidth:[600,1600]};
export function validateTheme(theme){if(!theme||typeof theme!=='object'||Array.isArray(theme))throw Error('Theme must be a JSON object');if(Object.keys(theme).some(k=>!Object.hasOwn(themeDefaults,k)))throw Error('Unknown theme field');const result={...themeDefaults,...theme};if(typeof result.name!=='string'||!result.name.trim()||result.name.length>100)throw Error('Name must be 1–100 characters');for(const k of colors)if(typeof result[k]!=='string'||!/^#[0-9a-f]{6}$/i.test(result[k]))throw Error(k+' must be a six-digit hex color');for(const k of ['headingFont','bodyFont'])if(!fonts.includes(result[k]))throw Error(k+' must be a built-in font family');for(const [k,[min,max]] of Object.entries(ranges))if(typeof result[k]!=='number'||!Number.isFinite(result[k])||result[k]<min||result[k]>max)throw Error(k+' must be between '+min+' and '+max);return result}
export function proposeTheme({boardId,sourcePin,currentTheme,nextTheme}){return {kind:'prototype_theme_proposal_v1',boardId,sourcePin,baseTheme:JSON.stringify(currentTheme??null),theme:validateTheme(nextTheme)}}
export function applyThemeProposal(proposal,{boardId,sourcePin,currentTheme}){if(proposal.boardId!==boardId||proposal.sourcePin!==sourcePin||proposal.baseTheme!==JSON.stringify(currentTheme??null))throw Error('Theme proposal is stale or belongs to another document');return validateTheme(proposal.theme)}
